  "title": "From the Depths",
  "subtitle": "Tales from the Archives of Miskatonic University",
  "description": "From the creator of The Lost Son ( https://redcircle.com/shows/80553a05-2842-4f0d-ad8a-9b042335f010 ) comes a new audio drama series! From the Depths: Tales from the Archives of Miskatonic University follows assistant archivist Beryl Hastings (Cassandra Cavallaro) as she chronicles first-hand accounts of strange encounters with eldritch nightmares in early twentieth century America. In these inaugural episodes, she interviews New Orleans private detective Marcus Devane (Marcus Ellison, Jr.) in a series of accounts inspired by classic tales of cosmic horror!",
